{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-03T08:46:29.471Z","data":{"text":"Task complete. Summary of what I did:\n\n**Implementation (3 files):**\n- `src/cli/report.ts`, `src/cli/query.ts`, `src/cli/digest.ts` — options interfaces now extend `CommandInputs`; each resolves `cwd`/writers/config via `resolveInputs`, loads config at the same point as before, and writes `${text}\\n` to `inputs.stdout`. Return values and `digest --out` behavior unchanged.\n\n**Tests:**\n- `tests/report.test.ts` / `tests/report-json.test.ts` — assert the writer receives the returned text plus `\\n`, then use the return value for body assertions.\n- `tests/command-inputs-history.test.ts` (new) — runs `report`, `report --json`, `query <select>`, `query`, `digest <id>`, `digest <id> --json` both through `runCliCaptured` and directly with string-appending writers, asserting identical stdout/stderr. Also covers bare `digest` / `digest --json` refusals both ways. `HOME` is a temp dir so the real inbox wait log is never read.\n\n**Verification:** task verify (8/8 pass), `pnpm typecheck:cli`, `pnpm typecheck:ui`, `pnpm build`, `pnpm test`, and `pnpm lint` all pass.\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/142-command-inputs/.run/results/3.md`."}}
